{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Lane f041, 2026-10-19 09:10 PDT: the plan review for this story ran on origin/main c0cf1022671 at 09:05 PDT and returned INDETERMINATE, unsigned. Every plan-reviewer call got Bedrock 403 AccessDenied on us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8. The account's Bedrock daily spend cap tripped: the IAM policy BedrockDailySpendCapDeny (denies all Bedrock invoke actions) is attached to the Admin group and to the roles rebar-gerrit-instance-role, lmn-rebar-code-review and rebar-external-ci-bedrock. Its description says it detaches automatically at 00:00 UTC (17:00 PDT). Until then neither the local nor the MCP gate path can review, and the Gerrit LLM-Review bot is likely blocked too. Not worked around: switching to the direct Anthropic provider would bypass a spending control. The story is unclaimed and no code has been touched; the refreshed description, file impact and inventory comment are in place for the re-run."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792426224854907001,"uuid":"32befc50-8b74-4a04-9aed-699a0645c2cf"}